@startuml
title US-08: View Borrow History & Evidence
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database DB

User -> Frontend : Open borrow history & evidence
Frontend -> Backend : GET /api/transactions/borrower/{id} or /item/{itemId}
Backend -> DB : Fetch Transaction & EvidenceProof
DB --> Backend : Records

alt Not found
    Backend --> Frontend : 404 Not Found
    Frontend --> User : Record not found
else Non-participant
    Backend --> Frontend : 403 Forbidden
    Frontend --> User : Access denied
else Participant
    Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK (handover & return proofs)
    Frontend --> User : Show timeline, photos & notes
end
@enduml
